      "text": "```\nLEGAL DEFINITION (EU Spirits Regulation):\n  \"A spirit drink produced from ethyl alcohol of agricultural origin\n   obtained following fermentation with yeast...characterized by the\n   absence of a distinctive aroma...Minimum 37.5% ABV\""
