      },
      "text": "US TTB Definition (27 CFR 5.22):\n  \"Neutral spirits, so distilled, or so treated after distillation with\n   charcoal or other materials, as to be without distinctive character,\n   aroma, taste, or color\"\n  Minimum 40% ABV (80 proof)"
